  <item>
    <title>22. 年终总结（上）：原来我们不一样！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694cde52946dca09254431a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694cde52946dca09254431a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Dec 2025 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【写在前面】</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈喽，大家好~我是走走。25年的年终播客如期而至。我们用了几个很有趣的动物塑问题来开头，本来以为我们的答案会一样，结果没想到完全不一样。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>死亡来临时，你希望它是何种形态？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A.如秋叶般静美地飘落，回归大地</span></p><span></span><p><span>B.像烟花一样，在最绚烂的瞬间燃烧殆尽</span></p><span></span><p><span>C.像一场远航，驶向未知的星辰大海</span></p><span></span><p><span>D.像一场酣睡，在最温暖的梦中不再醒来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>你退休后，打算在哪里开一家“只招待有缘人”的奇怪小店？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A.在宇宙空间站里，开一家“失物招领处”</span></p><span></span><p><span>B.在移动岛屿上，开一家“能量补给站”</span></p><span></span><p><span>C.在图书馆地下室，开一家“懒人沙发店”</span></p><span></span><p><span>D.在珠穆朗玛峰顶，开一家“灵魂便利店”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>你发现了一个可以穿梭时空的罗盘，第一次启动时，你希望指针指向哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A.指向魔法与巨龙存在的失落古代</span></p><span></span><p><span>B.指向科技高度发达人人安居乐业的理想未来</span></p><span></span><p><span>C.指向尚未被探索的充满原始生命力的秘境</span></p><span></span><p><span>D.指向你童年最无忧无虑的那个夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>在生命的尽头，你回望一生，最让你感到自豪的是？</span></p><span></span><p><span>A.我从未背叛过我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>B.我用生命守护了我爱的一切</span></p><span></span><p><span>C.我过得舒适安逸，没留下什么遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span>D.我达到了无人企及的高度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> &nbsp;你觉得你今年过的怎么样?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">38:39</a> &nbsp;对你今年的生活打个分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> &nbsp;用一两句话来形容一下你的四季?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2774">46:14</a> &nbsp;有认识一些新的人和朋友吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2971">49:31</a> &nbsp;这一年有吃过印象深刻的好吃的，好喝的吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3489">58:09</a> &nbsp;有没有和老朋友碰碰面呢?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3599">59:59</a> &nbsp;对自己明年有什么期待吗?有期望完成什么突破吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3648">60:48</a> &nbsp;给2026没事就好想3个播客主题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3941">65:41</a> &nbsp;最后选一首歌作为年度歌曲吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【固定结尾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：来自《没事就好》主播走走即兴创作</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：《Numb Little Bug》</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《这条小鱼在乎》</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还可以在这些地方收听我们：苹果播客，QQ音乐，spotify，castbox</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65d2ccdc86313e41a50098ee/ll5l0sgkFxPU9Q3w_I75pi6GaoUk.m4a" length="70314911" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQkFiMVJzT_GxCIJC4nAFUVFdbp.png"/>
